Subject: [PATCH 1/2] book: add doc-region markers for the Sphinx teaching book

Comment-only. Adds // doc-region-begin/end <name> markers so the imps GZDoom
book can literalinclude source spans by NAME (drift-proof), never line numbers.

Spans marked:
  src/d_main.cpp                 doom_loop, startup_to_loop, game_main_entry
  src/d_iwad.cpp                 scan_iwad, iwad_picker_decision
  src/common/filesystem/source/filesystem.cpp   init_multiple_files

No code changes; proven comment-only by tools/check_comment_only_streams.sh.
---
 src/common/filesystem/source/filesystem.cpp | 2 ++
 src/d_iwad.cpp                              | 4 ++++
 src/d_main.cpp                              | 6 ++++++
 3 files changed, 12 insertions(+)

